    'Missão do Alexandre‡Alexander\'s Quest‡Alexanders Quest‡Alexander\'s Quest‡Alexander\'s Quest‡‡La quête d\'Alexander‡Alexander\'s Quest‡',
    nil,
    'Encontre um lugar esquecido e lance o feitiço.‡Find the forgotten location and cast the magical spell.‡Find the forgotten location and cast the magical spell.‡Kill 2 Koboldz.‡Find the forgotten location and cast the magical spell.‡Matar alimaña kóbold, dos.‡Trouvez l\'endroit oublié et lancez un sort.‡Kill 2 Koboldz.‡',
