    'A canção do Jim‡Песня Джима <CHANGE TO GOSSIP>‡Jims Lied <ZU TRATSCH WECHSELN>‡짐의 노래‡La canción de Jim <CHANGE TO GOSSIP>‡‡La chanson de Jim <CHANGE TO GOSSIP>‡吉姆的歌谣‡吉姆的歌謠<CHANGE TO GOSSIP>',
